From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] kernelbase: precise interrupt time, file streams, fail-fast, drivers, page files

- QueryInterruptTimePrecise and QueryUnbiasedInterruptTimePrecise gave
  the value of the last timer tick; they read the clock (the performance
  counter, the same monotonic clock in the same units) now.
- FindFirstStreamW and FindNextStreamW listed nothing. ntdll answers
  FileStreamInformation (a file's "::$DATA" stream and its size; named
  streams are not kept here, and a directory has none), which also makes
  GetFileInformationByHandleEx(FileStreamInfo) work; the find handle is
  closed by FindClose.
- RaiseFailFastException ended every process with
  STATUS_FAIL_FAST_EXCEPTION. It ends it with the exception's own code,
  logs the record (Office's fail-fast tags are in its parameters), and a
  debugger sees it as a second-chance exception first.
- EnumDeviceDrivers listed nothing and GetDeviceDriverBaseName/FileName
  were empty; they list the system's modules (SystemModuleInformation).
- EnumPageFilesA/W failed; the swap space is reported as the page file
  C:\pagefile.sys (none without swap).

Wine's kernel32 file tests: no new failures.

Gate: test/kbmisc-gate.sh. Mutants SG_MUTANT_NO_FILE_STREAMS
(ntdll/unix/file.c, kernelbase/file.c), SG_MUTANT_NO_DEVICE_DRIVERS,
SG_MUTANT_NO_PAGE_FILES (kernelbase/debug.c).
---
--- a/dlls/kernelbase/debug.c
+++ b/dlls/kernelbase/debug.c
@@ -416,8 +416,30 @@ __ASM_GLOBAL_IMPORT(RaiseException)
  */
 void WINAPI DECLSPEC_HOTPATCH RaiseFailFastException( EXCEPTION_RECORD *record, CONTEXT *context, DWORD flags )
 {
-    FIXME( "(%p, %p, %ld) stub\n", record, context, flags );
-    TerminateProcess( GetCurrentProcess(), STATUS_FAIL_FAST_EXCEPTION );
+    EXCEPTION_RECORD rec;
+    CONTEXT ctx;
+
+    /* No handler runs; a debugger sees it as a second-chance exception, and
+     * the process ends with the exception's code (Office's fail-fast tags
+     * were lost: every one ended as STATUS_FAIL_FAST_EXCEPTION). */
+    if (!record)
+    {
+        memset( &rec, 0, sizeof(rec) );
+        rec.ExceptionCode = STATUS_FAIL_FAST_EXCEPTION;
+        rec.ExceptionFlags = EXCEPTION_NONCONTINUABLE;
+        rec.ExceptionAddress = __builtin_return_address(0);
+        record = &rec;
+    }
+    if (!context)
+    {
+        RtlCaptureContext( &ctx );
+        context = &ctx;
+    }
+    ERR( "fail-fast exception %#lx at %p (flags %#lx, %lu parameters: %#Ix %#Ix %#Ix)\n",
+         record->ExceptionCode, record->ExceptionAddress, flags, record->NumberParameters,
+         record->ExceptionInformation[0], record->ExceptionInformation[1], record->ExceptionInformation[2] );
+    if (IsDebuggerPresent()) NtRaiseException( record, context, FALSE );
+    TerminateProcess( GetCurrentProcess(), record->ExceptionCode );
 }
 
